rust, and estate administration services for individuals, as well as pension, profit-sharing, and employee benefit plan administration services for corporations. Further, the company offers insurance agency services comprising group health care policies and life insurance, and property and casualty insurance products. The company was founded in 1851 and is headquartered in Glens Falls, New York."}}